"segregation":"","inheritance":"AR","previously_reported":"","mixed_genotypes":false,"quotes":["a homozygous 10 kb deletion of exon 2 in a well-established male infertility gene (M1AP)","we identified a pathogenic single-exon deletion in M1AP that would be undetectable by WES"],"quote_grounding":[1.0,1.0],"followup_of":"","genotype_mode":"AR","genotype_reason":"stated for the family"}],"notes":[{"id":"N:38073178:1","pmid":"38073178","section":"molecular_genetics","statement":"Khan et al. (2025) performed whole-genome sequencing of 26 individuals from 7 large Pakistani families with male infertility, 5 of them consanguineous. They identified plausible genetic causes in 5 of the 7 families (71%), a much higher yield than the 20% they had achieved with whole-exome sequencing of unrelated singleton cases.","inheritance":"UNKNOWN","quotes":["We recruited seven large families with clinically diagnosed male infertility from rural Pakistan, including five with a history of consanguinity. We generated WGS data on 26 individuals (3-5 per family)","The rate of genetic findings using the current approach (71%) was much higher than what we recently achieved using whole-exome sequencing (WES) of unrelated singleton cases (20%)."],"quote_grounding":[1.0,1.0]},{"id":"N:31502483:1","pmid":"31502483","section":"molecular_genetics","statement":"Sha et al. (2019) found that the homozygous CCDC9 p.Ser109Leu variant was predicted to be highly pathogenic by in silico analysis, and that spermatozoa carrying it had significantly reduced CCDC9 protein and severely damaged morphology and ultrastructure. They concluded that CCDC9 may be a novel pathogenic gene for severe asthenozoospermia.","inheritance":"AR","quotes":["The variant was highly pathogenic and was predicted to be a candidate gene for asthenozoospermia through in silico analysis.","Therefore, CCDC9 may be a novel pathogenic gene associated with severe asthenozoospermia."],"quote_grounding":[1.0,1.0]}],"dropped":{"records":[],"notes":[]},"gene_decisions":{"candidates":["CCDC9","SPAG6","TUBA3C","TKTL1","M1AP"],"confirmed":["CCDC9"],"dropped":[],"not_confirmed":["SPAG6","TUBA3C","TKTL1","M1AP"]},"candidate_inheritance":["AR"]}